    "Question #: 10": {
      "Title": "Exam 1z0-1054-22 topic 1 question 15 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You entered a cross validation rule to prevent the balance sheet cost center (000) being used with Profit and Loss Accounts (4000-ZZZZ)."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The following combinations exist in the Code Combination table:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "01-000-4110-00, 01-000-5299-000, 01-000-5105-000 and 01-000-7640-00"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which two statements are true regarding cross-validation rules? (Choose two.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. You need to run the Cross-Validation Rule Violations process to allow rules to apply to existing combinations that violate rules."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. If Dynamic Combination Creation Allowed is not enabled for your chart of accounts instance you are required to create cross validation rules."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. The rules will validate and apply to new and existing accounts."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. The rules validate and apply to new accounts only."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. You need to run the Cross-Validation Rule Violations process to list and optionally disable combinations that violate rules."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: CE \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
