          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Use General Ledger's Balance Transfer programs to transfer subsidiary ledger balances to the parent ledger, and then enter eliminating entries as a separate balancing segment in the parent ledger."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Use Oracle Hyperion Financial Management for this type of complex consolidation."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Use General Ledger's Financial Reporting functionality to produce consolidated reports by balancing segment where each report represents a different subsidiary. Any eliminating entries can be entered in yet another separate balancing segment."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
