          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What happens to segments in your source general ledger, such as Program, that cannot be mapped to Hyperion Financial Management?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Data is summarized across segments that are not mapped to Hyperion Financial Management."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. The unmapped segments default to future use segments in Hyperion Financial Management."
            }
          ]
